 248:./inc/core_cm7.h **** /*******************************************************************************
 249:./inc/core_cm7.h ****  *                 Register Abstraction
 250:./inc/core_cm7.h ****   Core Register contain:
 251:./inc/core_cm7.h ****   - Core Register
