 243:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h **** /**
 244:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Set Control Register
 245:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Writes the given value to the Control Register.
 246:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \param [in]    control  Control Register value to set
 247:./inc/cmsis_gcc.h ****  */
